Package: orca-web
Version: __ORCA_VERSION__
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: dewei <860656812@qq.com>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libgcc-s1, libssl3, libsodium23, libstdc++6
Description: orca-web hub server (orca-server)
 Headless WebSocket hub for the orca-web remote-access pair: it relays
 end-to-end-encrypted traffic between the home gateway and mobile clients
 and never sees plaintext. Runs behind a reverse proxy on 127.0.0.1:8788.
 Depends are the shared libraries the binary is linked against on
 Debian/Ubuntu amd64; rebuild the package from source for other targets.
